# Important project files are deliberately not ignored. Commit the LaTeX
# source, final report PDF, Python code, figures, Markdown records, and any
# data that is permitted and expected to be shared. The simulator itself is
# synthetic by design, see AI/PROJECT.md. No real check-in data belongs here.

# Downloaded papers. These are legitimately open-access copies, downloaded
# for personal reading, not republished here; keep them local, not in git
# history, which a push could make public regardless of this repository's
# current visibility.
paper/literature/
